            "paragraph": "The gridded sea-level dataset used for validation in this study is the C3S Global Ocean Level-4 SLA product (hereafter referred to as C3S), produced by Collecte Localisation Satellites (CLS) and publicly available through the Copernicus Climate Data Store (Product DOI: https://doi.org/10.48670/moi-00145, last access: 24 December 2025). The C3S dataset provides global coverage on a 0.25\u00b0 \u00d7 0.25\u00b0 grid and currently spans the period from January 1993 to May 2025. It is routinely updated in delayed mode, with an approximate latency of five months. Both daily and monthly gridded products are distributed in NetCDF-4 format.",
